{"ID":"20240220132630-nkn60t4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132630-nkn60t4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132630-nkn60t4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163134-uy8tuu8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163031-693lbel\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163134-4xhoyz5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【大柴胡汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312163134"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312163134-uy8tuu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163134-uy8tuu8","updated":"20240312163134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一百零七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163134-50qvkue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163134-50qvkue","updated":"20240312163134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：服「柴胡汤」已,渴者,属「阳明」也,以法治之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163134-jvcf0jp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163134-jvcf0jp","updated":"20240312163134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人吃桂枝汤，第二天胃口开，代表病好了。如果是内脏病，半夜，因为是阴，半夜胃口开，代表病好了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"渴跟胃气恢复有雷同的功能"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你原来是柴胡汤症，吃过柴胡汤变成渴，进入阳明证，阳明无死症，也是好现象。以法治之，如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"渴有小便不利是五苓散。如果大渴烦躁，大便正常，有壮热是白虎汤。便秘渴承气汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163134-dc760aj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163134-dc760aj","updated":"20240312163134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从少阳症变成阳明证是病人好转的现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163134-nwebep1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163134-nwebep1","updated":"20240312163134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大肠癌很好治，不是承气汤就是大柴胡汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本来是肠癌，你开刀，从肠癌移转肝癌，本来是阳明证，结果变成厥阴证，到了厥阴症以后，西医就没有办法了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163134-4xhoyz5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163134-4xhoyz5"}},{"ID":"20240312163100-0cm7o5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-0cm7o5x","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百一十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-9vagrww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-9vagrww","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」,过经十余日,反二三下之,后四五日,「柴胡证」仍在者,先与「小柴胡汤」。呕不止,心下急,郁郁微烦者,为未解也,与「大柴胡汤」下之则愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-d2jfvkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-d2jfvkz","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"意思是说过太阳症了，我们看到病人有柴胡汤症，比如往来寒热，胸胁苦满，恶心，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"开小柴胡汤。但呕吐并没有止，心下急,郁郁微烦者,为未解也,与「大柴胡汤」下之则愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-k18xebr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-k18xebr","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加上前面，得出一个结论，如果病是在太阳跟少阳中间，只要有少阳症，这就是小柴胡汤。所以张仲景把小柴胡汤定义的条辨放在，病人出现"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"介于太阳和少阳兼症的时候，用小柴胡汤。当出现少阳跟阳明兼症的时候，才是大柴胡汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的现象。这样区分什么时候用大柴胡汤，什么时候用小柴胡汤。受到阳明兼症，一定有烦躁便秘。如果没有只是往来寒热，头痛兼少阳症，我们知道小柴胡汤。所以小柴胡汤的设计适用于单纯的少阳证，或者是兼一点太阳症。但是当你没有了太阳证，进入少阳跟阳明的时候，只有一剂是大柴胡汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个大柴胡汤不得了，临床上大肠癌，你无法想象他效果多好。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-l07beo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-l07beo1","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大柴胡汤在少阳阳明。大柴胡汤里面有大黄，有时候我们会用到芒硝，少阳经也兼顾到。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大柴胡汤出现的时候，病人一定兼有便秘同时兼有少阳证的现象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比如往来寒热，胸胁苦满，恶心，便秘。小柴胡汤不能治疗便秘。一定要大柴胡汤才能治疗便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-d9a4ch3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-d9a4ch3","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 138px;","style":"width: 128px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240229103501-zbue0ix.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 128px;\" parent-style=\"width: 138px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-ajwxo9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-ajwxo9l","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大柴胡汤帮助很多大肠癌的，没有开刀的，开了刀就不一样了。大肠如果有肿瘤，大肠和肝之间有个血管连通，全身上下只有这个血管没有瓣膜，所以你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果开了刀以后，癌症会从这个血管进入肝脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个西医都知道，但是他还是要开。到我们手上变成肝是厥阴症，厥阴证是寒热并结的一种现象。就是你是看到寒，也是看到热，可是你用桂枝麻黄葛根都不对症。本来是阳明症结果变成厥阴证。为什么会大便排不出来，西医不会用芒硝跟大黄。而且光靠芒硝跟大黄还不行，要配合柴胡汤在里面，才能够去掉它。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-45o02we","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-45o02we","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床病人肿瘤长在大肠头，我就按照经方开，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄牡丹皮汤症，把你当盲肠炎来治疗，同时薏仁附子败酱散，复方在里面。吃了大便开始排了。排到肿块没了，一直吃到大柴胡汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。进入大柴胡汤的时候，病人有便秘，有往来寒热，有恶心。他在吃大柴胡的时候，刚开始他太太弄错了，我给他吃的是一个礼拜的药，结果他三个礼拜才来找我，我叫他吃三勺，他吃一勺，吃了三个礼拜。我问他大便好不好，他说不好。我吓得赶快带他到门诊看，做给他看吃多少。他吃错了。这个还是粉剂。量加回去大便就出来了。半年现在都好好的。大柴胡汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-wwyhjeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-wwyhjeu","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大柴胡汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-ddge2kr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-ddge2kr","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡半斤，黄芩三两，芍药三两，半夏半升洗，生姜五两切，枳实四两炙，大枣十二枚劈，大黄二钱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-ij9u416","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-ij9u416","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右八味,以水一斗二升,煮取六升,去滓,再煎,取三升,温服一升,日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-9oji0h9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-9oji0h9","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大柴胡汤比小柴胡汤多了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实、大黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小柴胡汤有人参。因为大柴胡汤有便秘，大黄把它清出来。枳实能够宽肠。如果说，柴胡汤看到病人有腹满，腹部胀满的时候，你要加厚朴下去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-rks8h6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-rks8h6o","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黄跟芒硝有差异，芒硝攻坚，大黄去实。攻坚，大便很硬，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芒硝可以把它切碎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-5aiykvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-5aiykvl","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硫磺你吃下去，如果真的中毒，舌头麻全身麻痹不能动，没关系，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"烧鸭吃一口，鸭肉解硫磺的毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而且那个毒是热毒，不是真正的毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-vzaxn3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-vzaxn3e","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黄去实，大便堵到，大黄只能推它，堵到的时候，有时候是软的。软的你不需要加芒硝了。硬的时候才要加芒硝。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么知道硬软，你去压他，拒按，不放屁，就要靠芒硝了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为大肠被大便塞住了，当然屁都没有了。有一个人来找你，屁很多，堵在小肠里，因为大肠没有东西，所以肠气一直排出来。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"放屁很多小承气汤。大承气汤是屁也不放一个。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你问什么时候用芒硝，你问他有没有放屁，没有放屁，芒硝。芒硝煮过效果就不好，生用，大柴胡汤煮完以后，你把芒硝放下，汤药冲下去喝，才有办法打出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163100-gehdbms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163100-gehdbms","updated":"20240312163100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没有大黄不叫大柴胡汤。有的时候会用到芒硝。如果诸位用到这个处方的话，大肠癌就是可以治的。绝对不会死人。你只要通利一段时间以后，自然而然他就恢复了，肿块就慢慢消除掉了。因为病是在阳明，少阳阳明。无死症。不要动他，一开刀，就变成厥阴，救都来不及救了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163101-p2etg22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163101-p2etg22"}},{"ID":"20240312163042-5735yj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163042-5735yj5","updated":"20240312163042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百五十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163042-x4142pv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163042-x4142pv","updated":"20240312163042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" 原文：「伤寒」十余日,热结在里,复往来寒热者,与「大柴胡汤」。但「结胸」无大热者,此与水结在胸胁也,但头微汗出者,「大陷胸汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163042-la8h8e9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163042-la8h8e9","updated":"20240312163042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也是伤寒，十几天了，应该是传经了。热结在里,复往来寒热者,我们给他大柴胡汤。如果是往来寒热、胸胁苦满。胸胁苦满包含什么？胸胁讲的两个肋的下方，胀满。如果病人没有胀满，只是右上腹这里一点痛，或者是右变肝区痛，就一点痛，还是属于胸胁苦满，所以我们治疗胆结石或者肝有问题，都是以柴胡为主，至于柴胡里面加什么药，看他什么位置如何加减。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163042-119qrdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163042-119qrdp","updated":"20240312163042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个我们给他大柴胡汤，如果是结胸，没有大热者，此与水结在胸胁也,但头微汗出者,「大陷胸汤」主之。也就是说如果是你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"水停在胸膈这边的时候，大柴胡汤一定会有便秘的现象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，胸胁苦满会有便秘、而且比较燥热，因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大柴胡汤症比较介于少阳跟阳明中间。所以才会兼有渴和便秘的现象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163042-vqxmwdw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163042-vqxmwdw","updated":"20240312163042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果说这个人没有大热了，代表表邪完全下陷，水结在胸膈。一般水结在胸腔的时候，心下都会胀满痛，有时候不按都会痛，拒按。喜按的时候小陷胸汤，比较轻微，按下去比较舒服。像这里水结在这边，会用到大陷胸汤的时候都是拒按，拒按为实。虚症，里面没有东西，喜按。就好像肚子腹满，你压他感觉很舒服，喜按。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹胀喜按，厚朴、生姜、半夏、人参、甘草汤症。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果按下去很痛，拒按，是大便堵到。腹诊拒按跟喜按很明显。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163043-mbzt5gu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163043-mbzt5gu"}},{"ID":"20240312163022-raek6ee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163022-raek6ee","updated":"20240312163022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百八十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163022-cjf26yw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163022-cjf26yw","updated":"20240312163022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,发热、汗出不解,心下痞鞕,呕吐而下利者,「大柴胡汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163022-8moiosx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163022-8moiosx","updated":"20240312163022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便会有问题，恶心、呕吐。诸位要知道什么时候可以用大柴胡汤的时候，病人有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小柴胡汤症，同时兼有一点便秘的现象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。呕就是小柴胡汤了，恶心。没有说一定要往来寒热，胸胁苦满，其实不用，恶心就是小柴胡，大便不利，这个时候就可以使用大柴胡汤。大柴胡汤方剂里面有大黄，如果是在肛门口堵到，这个时候你可以加一点芒硝下去，把干硬的东西打掉。芒硝攻坚，咸味的药都有攻坚的效果。即使他的硬块是燥矢，干燥的大便，或者是大肠癌的肿瘤，都可以使用芒硝，一定要让他大便通出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163031-693lbel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163031-693lbel"}}]}